00:00:54.454 --> 00:00:57.724 size:53% position:73% line:53%
-  Donc, c'est beaucoup de

00:00:55.655 --> 00:00:58.892 size:53% position:73% line:53%
stress. Puis en plus, ma mère,

00:00:56.857 --> 00:01:01.294 size:53% position:73% line:53%
